## 📊 异常概览与现象

| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |
|---|---|---|---|
| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Application startup failure due to missing configuration (CONFIG_MISSING) |

